# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — TRADENOVA
## Build a complete, modern, full-stack Indian stock market platform with AI

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, fintech product designer, backend architect, database engineer, AI engineer, cybersecurity specialist, and QA engineer.

Build a complete, functional, production-minded web application named **TradeNova**. It should provide the core user experience of a modern Indian stock trading and investment platform, combining a professional trading terminal, investment portfolio analytics, market research, watchlists, price alerts, and AI-powered stock analysis.

This is an original product. Do not use Zerodha's name, logo, proprietary assets, or copied branding. Create an original TradeNova identity.

**Most important:** Do not build only a static landing page or a nonfunctional dashboard. Implement real authentication, MongoDB persistence, backend APIs, working navigation, functional forms, stock-data integration, portfolio calculations, AI features, and error handling. Every important button must work.

If a third-party credential is missing, implement the integration interface and clearly labelled demo mode. Never pretend that a mock response is real market data.

